stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED
    QUEUED --> DONE: Parse, encode and commit
    QUEUED --> FAILED: Roll back import savepoint
    FAILED --> [*]
    DONE --> [*]

    state Review {
      [*] --> AUTO_ASSESSED
      AUTO_ASSESSED --> IN_REVIEW: Member provides rationale
      IN_REVIEW --> VERIFIED: Reviewer approves
      IN_REVIEW --> REJECTED: Reviewer rejects
      IN_REVIEW --> NEEDS_MORE_EVIDENCE: Reviewer returns
      NEEDS_MORE_EVIDENCE --> IN_REVIEW: Member resubmits
    }
